id: minion-supporter-second-effect
name: Minion Supporter
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: minion-supporter
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Minion Supporter's second effect, as a Maneuver: the Empower as if 1 Action, at one of your Minions - its Combat Rolls 1(T) till the start of your next turn.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: You can use the Empower Maneuver (as if you spent 1 Action) as an Instant Maneuver. If you do, you must target one of your Minions and that Minion has its Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

# Which of your Minions, asked; the Empower at it as if 1 Action was spent, then its mark on your clock (chat.mjs supporterEmpower).
[on used]
supporterEmpower();
